Z||000003||Jay||08-20-2001||07:16 PM||||I've got Cyberdyne digital speedo.  I like it. gives me 1/4 mile, top speed and 0-60 times as well as odometer and trip.  I tried it out at the track and is acurate to about 1/10th of a second.  Recomend them.  Next is a tach.<P>------------------<BR>Jay<BR>1986 Northstar GT<BR>www.members.home.net/jaygrande<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/cayuga3_3.jpg"> ||||reg||1
