Z||000005||fix||08-20-2001||08:59 PM||||To anybody really interested in getting some digital gauges, I have some that I would consider selling if the price was right.  I bought a truck a while back that had digital gauges installed and I removed them all because I junked the truck.  I considered using them in my fiero, but I don't want to make a custom instrument pod.  I don't have any senders for them, but you can get those from Jegs or Summit. Here are all the gauges that I have. <P>Speedometer 3 3/8" (not the one with 0-60 times and all that.  Just a speedo)<BR>Tach  3 3/8"<BR>Oil pressure  2 1/16"<BR>Water Temp  2 1/16"<BR>Trans Temp  2 1/16"<BR>Voltage  2 1/16"<BR>Gas gauge  2 1/16"<P>Let me know if you're interested.  And I don't really want to split them all up, so don't ask me for just the speedometer or just the tach.  BTW, the gauges are all in decent condition.  As I recall the speedometer has a few scratches on the black rim that goes around the face, but nothing very substantial.  Sorry to get so commercial on everyone, but I'm done now.  ||||reg||1
