Z||000009||Jay||08-21-2001||01:48 PM||||Yes I'll be at the show, I'm one of the judges (not in my own class).  I got my gauges from Noyzboyz custom exhaust but you can get them at Race-Tech (Fiero Shop) or even Performance Improvements.  3 3/8 is the size for speedo and tach but you've gotta modify it a little.<P>Fix what do you want for the whole lot of them?  What kind of digital gauge are they. e-mail me at jaygrande@home.com<BR><P>------------------<BR>Jay<BR>1986 Northstar GT<BR>www.members.home.net/jaygrande<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/cayuga3_3.jpg"> ||||reg||1
