Z||000018||Jay||08-21-2001||10:32 PM||||Lil,There are I believe three signal outs on the Northstar ECM for speedo (or at least 2).  I just looked at the schematics to find out which pin out it  was and then attatched it to the speedo.  The first time it didn't work so I tried the second pin out and it worked.  Used the stock sensor too.  Also needs ground and ignition.<P>------------------<BR>Jay<BR>1986 Northstar GT<BR>www.members.home.net/jaygrande<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/cayuga3_3.jpg"> ||||reg||1
